      "id": "talking-avatar",
      "title": "Talking avatar ui:talking-avatar",
      "description": "An avatar that moves its mouth with speech. The lip-sync engine drives the mouth from a host level, an AnalyserNode, AnimationCue visemes or a synthetic envelope, through the controller handed out in avatar.ready — never through props. Expressions crossfade; blinking and breathing stop under reduced motion. Press the button to run the synthetic speech demo.",
